<title>POLAND: KRUSZWICA TURNS TO PLN 1 MLN LOSS IN MAY.</title>
<headline>KRUSZWICA TURNS TO PLN 1 MLN LOSS IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.03 vs   1.16 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1 27 vs   2.69 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.45 vs   3.74</p>
<p> Sales		   33.30 vs  36.55</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.36 vs   7.65 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.69 vs  16 61</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.45 vs  24.96</p>
<p> Sales		  199.53 vs 208.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish edible fat producer is Zaklady</p>
<p>Tluszczowe Kruszwica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
